      "writtenOn": "2014-02-07T02:03:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The transition between S0 and S3 is going to look messy as the initial state of the LED in suspend is going to be random, depending on the value of ticks. Please keep track of the previous chipset state and reset ticks to 0 on state changes. See \"previous_state_suspend\" in board/peppy/led.c",
